{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19142","headline":"白舍人曹长寄新诗有游宴之盛因以戏酬 · 刘禹锡","name":"白舍人曹长寄新诗有游宴之盛因以戏酬","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"苏州刺史例能诗，西掖今来替左司。\n二八城门开道路，五千兵马引旌旗。\n水通山寺笙歌去，骑过虹桥劒戟随。\n若共吴王鬬百草，不如应是欠西施。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19142.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19142","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}